+  OPEN/TIMEOUT:      r = 1,2,3
+  details: r=1 not run after lower branches consumed cap
+           r=2 GF(32003)/slimgb timeout 120.198s
+           r=3 GF(32003)/slimgb timeout 60.226s
+           r=3 GF(32003)/facstd timeout 120.139s
