+
+## Controls
+
+MEASURED.  The K=16 t=3 normalized K-field control was rerun from the charged
+preprocessed script:
+
+```text
+CONTROL_ACTUAL_PAIR_PASS J=gamma
+CONTROL_C_UNIT_PASS
