+`r>=5`; `r=4` is modular-empty only; `r=1,2,3` remain open.  No saturated-empty
+theorem applies.
+
+`(27,18;21;8;k=4)`: `OPEN[LOW-R3-BRANCH]`.  Exact-empty is known only for
